### Obtain Token
# Credentials come from http-client.private.env.json (git-ignored), e.g.
# {"dev": {"username": "...", "password": "..."}}
# The tokens come back as HttpOnly cookies, which the HTTP client stores and resends.
POST http://localhost:8000/a/token/obtain/
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{username}}&password={{password}}

### Use the access cookie to Get Hashtags
GET http://localhost:8000/b/storage_api/hashtags/


### Refresh (rotates both cookies)
POST http://localhost:8000/a/token/refresh/

### Use the new access cookie to Get Hashtags
GET http://localhost:8000/b/storage_api/hashtags/

### Logout (revokes the refresh token, deletes the cookies)
POST http://localhost:8000/a/token/logout/
